WEBVTT

01:35.830 --> 01:38.259
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.509 --> 01:41.289
[Episode 16]

01:55.509 --> 01:56.310
What's wrong?

01:58.070 --> 02:01.260
Whose girlfriend is this beautiful lady?

02:01.490 --> 02:02.090
Oh, right.

02:02.290 --> 02:02.730
Mine.

02:04.530 --> 02:05.930
Where is your e-scooter?

02:06.190 --> 02:08.120
It's so bright and sunny today—

02:08.240 --> 02:09.389
perfect for a nice stroll

02:09.389 --> 02:10.710
and a little shopping.

02:10.729 --> 02:12.240
What do you say, my lady?

02:12.270 --> 02:13.200
Sure.

02:13.510 --> 02:14.230
Then...

02:14.820 --> 02:15.350
Let's go.

02:16.460 --> 02:17.090
Let's go.

02:22.540 --> 02:24.000
The sun is so strong today.

02:24.390 --> 02:26.520
What if my girlfriend gets sunburned?

02:26.660 --> 02:27.340
Lan,

02:27.340 --> 02:30.030
do you want to go somewhere else
for our date?

02:30.030 --> 02:31.100
Let's go to the musical instrument store.

02:31.100 --> 02:32.829
The musical instrument store?

02:33.500 --> 02:34.310
You

02:34.620 --> 02:35.060
don't

02:35.230 --> 02:37.829
still have feelings for Shan, do you?

02:37.850 --> 02:39.380
What are you talking about?

02:40.380 --> 02:41.060
I...

02:41.750 --> 02:42.940
invited Mengmeng.

02:46.590 --> 02:48.510
It's our first date today,

02:48.620 --> 02:50.260
and you invited Mengmeng?

02:50.280 --> 02:51.780
Mengmeng just went through a breakup.

02:51.780 --> 02:53.640
She needs some company right now.

02:53.640 --> 02:54.820
Besides, she won't come until evening.

02:54.820 --> 02:56.500
It won't affect our date.

02:57.400 --> 02:59.840
I'm not sure I want her to come.

02:59.870 --> 03:00.990
Please.

03:01.010 --> 03:02.610
You're the absolute best

03:02.640 --> 03:04.700
boyfriend in the entire world, okay?

03:05.100 --> 03:06.150
Fine, I guess...

03:07.660 --> 03:08.340
Are you alright?

03:08.340 --> 03:09.500
I'm fine.

03:11.940 --> 03:12.500
Wait.

03:13.030 --> 03:14.360
Your shoelace is loose.

03:18.100 --> 03:19.470
What if you trip and fall later?

03:19.470 --> 03:21.910
-I won't.
-Look carefully when you walk.

03:21.910 --> 03:23.040
Check these things.

03:24.600 --> 03:25.870
People are coming. Get up.

03:25.870 --> 03:26.750
Not done tying yet.

03:26.750 --> 03:27.470
Xiaole!

03:28.060 --> 03:29.170
-Uncle Li, hello.
-What kind of surprise

03:29.170 --> 03:30.340
-have you got for Yi Lan this time?
-Uncle Wang, hello.

03:30.340 --> 03:31.870
No, her shoelace was untied.
I was tying it.

03:31.870 --> 03:34.510
Lan, don't let Xiaole
sweep you off your feet.

03:34.660 --> 03:36.190
Your dad is really worried.

03:36.950 --> 03:38.210
I know, Uncle.

03:39.000 --> 03:41.040
Let's go. Let's go.

03:43.030 --> 03:44.060
Xiaole, going on a date?

03:44.060 --> 03:44.780
Hello, Aunties.

03:44.780 --> 03:45.340
Yeah.

03:46.100 --> 03:47.750
Look, what a lovely couple.

03:48.340 --> 03:49.540
Yeah. Have a nice day.

03:49.750 --> 03:50.310
Okay.

03:50.310 --> 03:51.060
Bye.

03:53.190 --> 03:55.470
Everyone in the neighborhood knows us.

03:55.470 --> 03:57.060
Can we keep a low profile?

03:57.100 --> 03:58.470
So what?

03:58.500 --> 04:00.060
I'm not embarrassed.

04:00.060 --> 04:01.340
You're my girlfriend.

04:01.660 --> 04:03.260
I'm not embarrassed either.

04:03.660 --> 04:05.780
But I'm just shy.

04:05.780 --> 04:06.540
Shy?

04:06.820 --> 04:08.820
-Let's go!
-Yi Lan is my girlfriend!

04:08.820 --> 04:09.540
Let's go!

04:11.270 --> 04:12.430
Sir, miss,

04:13.340 --> 04:14.940
your afternoon tea is ready.

04:15.060 --> 04:16.029
Thanks, Shan.

04:16.029 --> 04:16.540
Please enjoy.

04:16.540 --> 04:18.200
Thanks for the service, Shan.

04:33.090 --> 04:34.930
Why do you keep staring at me?

04:35.420 --> 04:36.420
Mm...

04:37.659 --> 04:38.420
Because...

04:38.740 --> 04:39.659
you're pretty.

04:41.420 --> 04:42.740
You're good-looking too.

04:42.740 --> 04:43.300
Oh?

04:45.090 --> 04:46.070
Which part?

04:47.070 --> 04:48.220
Hmm...

04:48.659 --> 04:49.630
Your eyes...

04:50.300 --> 04:51.360
are big and bright.

04:52.210 --> 04:55.930
Your nose looks like
it's straight out of a comic.

04:55.960 --> 04:57.520
And your lips...

04:57.540 --> 04:59.980
your lips look nice too.

05:04.740 --> 05:05.940
Don't say "oh" again.

05:08.100 --> 05:08.830
Then tell me.

05:10.510 --> 05:12.370
Who's better looking, me or Shan?

05:12.930 --> 05:16.130
Of course, my boyfriend looks the best.

05:16.180 --> 05:18.740
The best-looking in the whole wide world!

05:20.420 --> 05:21.620
Keep it down, you two!

05:21.740 --> 05:22.660
I can hear everything.

05:22.660 --> 05:23.340
Shh.

05:26.830 --> 05:29.170
Let's have some cake.

05:32.950 --> 05:33.540
Is it good?

05:33.540 --> 05:33.950
Yeah.

05:34.420 --> 05:35.020
It's good.

05:35.740 --> 05:36.220
I...

05:36.300 --> 05:37.230
I want a bite too.

05:38.180 --> 05:39.180
Here, have a bite.

05:42.470 --> 05:45.100
Big news! Big news!

05:51.510 --> 05:52.220
Chen Fan...

05:52.830 --> 05:54.159
Chen Fan got cheated on.

05:55.830 --> 05:56.540
I heard Ning

05:56.540 --> 05:58.390
got together with a violinist.

05:59.980 --> 06:01.780
How do you know that?

06:05.950 --> 06:07.410
Someone posted this video

06:07.510 --> 06:08.660
online.

06:08.780 --> 06:10.340
I called Chen Fan the other day.

06:10.340 --> 06:11.180
He was wasted

06:11.270 --> 06:13.270
and said Ning had broken up with him.

06:13.300 --> 06:14.830
Isn't that obvious enough?

06:15.180 --> 06:15.660
Impossible.

06:15.660 --> 06:17.390
Ning isn't that kind of person.

06:20.540 --> 06:23.000
You two don't actually believe that,
do you?

06:28.540 --> 06:29.540
He didn't answer.

06:29.780 --> 06:31.440
I can't reach Chen Fan either.

06:31.740 --> 06:32.600
He probably...

06:32.740 --> 06:34.860
broke down
and didn't want us to laugh at him.

06:34.860 --> 06:36.100
I told you,

06:36.220 --> 06:37.540
simps always end up

06:37.630 --> 06:38.830
with nothing.

06:41.540 --> 06:43.140
Can either of you reach Ning?

06:43.710 --> 06:45.300
I haven't been in touch
with her lately either.

06:45.300 --> 06:46.830
Maybe she's working part-time—

06:46.830 --> 06:47.630
she's so busy.

06:48.460 --> 06:48.940
Lan.

06:49.659 --> 06:50.420
Tong,

06:50.590 --> 06:51.659
you finally remembered me.

06:50.690 --> 06:51.720
[Chen Fan]

06:52.030 --> 06:53.030
He replied to you.

06:53.540 --> 06:54.180
Yeah.

06:54.180 --> 06:55.100
Well...

06:55.980 --> 06:57.740
I'll go find him then.

06:58.180 --> 06:58.740
Go...

06:59.180 --> 07:00.300
Go ahead.

07:00.630 --> 07:01.740
Sorry.

07:02.910 --> 07:03.660
Okay, I'm going then.

07:03.660 --> 07:03.980
Mm.

07:04.660 --> 07:05.180
Bye.

07:11.090 --> 07:11.690
Mengmeng,

07:11.980 --> 07:12.940
how have you been lately?

07:12.940 --> 07:14.140
Did you and your ex...

07:19.150 --> 07:20.750
I tried to get back together,

07:21.300 --> 07:23.300
but he already has a new girlfriend.

07:48.659 --> 07:49.590
Catch and shoot!

08:03.390 --> 08:04.790
Let's stop. Take a break.

08:05.980 --> 08:07.180
I'll go wash my hands.

08:08.220 --> 08:14.110
[Wash Basin]

08:12.150 --> 08:12.950
Come on.

08:19.710 --> 08:20.830
Don't mess with me.

08:39.260 --> 08:40.450
Come on.

08:49.900 --> 08:50.620
Have some?

08:56.180 --> 08:56.910
Tell me,

08:57.490 --> 08:59.020
what happened with you two?

09:03.270 --> 09:04.180
Tell me...

09:05.580 --> 09:07.640
did I really not understand her well?

09:09.890 --> 09:10.800
We broke up.

09:13.190 --> 09:14.190
She initiated it?

09:20.110 --> 09:21.910
Then what are you planning to do?

09:22.780 --> 09:24.180
My head is all over the place right now.

09:24.180 --> 09:25.660
I don't know what to do.

09:27.180 --> 09:29.700
It's just a breakup.
Is it worth all this drama?

09:29.700 --> 09:30.940
You're acting so pathetic.

09:30.940 --> 09:32.600
Don't make me look down on you.

09:35.300 --> 09:36.870
Why is dating so hard?

09:37.220 --> 09:37.910
Do you think

09:38.060 --> 09:39.820
she ever liked me at all?

09:42.660 --> 09:44.660
Whether she ever truly liked you...

09:45.270 --> 09:47.350
only you know that deep down.

09:48.030 --> 09:49.270
But I think

09:49.460 --> 09:51.390
she has always been someone who...

09:52.060 --> 09:53.270
admires strength.

09:54.660 --> 09:56.320
Her getting together with you

09:56.540 --> 09:59.060
in the first place might have just been
a pure coincidence.

09:59.060 --> 10:00.420
I really am pathetic.

10:01.420 --> 10:03.680
She even looked down on me over a breakup.

10:07.510 --> 10:08.350
Don't tell Mengmeng

10:08.350 --> 10:09.750
that you and I are dating.

10:10.150 --> 10:12.460
I have to help Mengmeng heal
before school starts,

10:12.460 --> 10:13.870
so let's not date for now.

10:15.110 --> 10:16.310
Get up, get up, get up.

10:16.540 --> 10:17.180
Get up.

10:20.780 --> 10:22.270
Do you know

10:22.270 --> 10:24.470
what's most important to you right now?

10:26.460 --> 10:28.260
It's to make yourself stronger.

10:31.420 --> 10:32.510
How can I do that?

10:35.150 --> 10:36.990
Don't you have a talent for composition?

10:36.990 --> 10:38.320
Use your musical talent

10:38.390 --> 10:39.250
to win her back.

10:41.780 --> 10:42.820
It's that...

10:45.630 --> 10:46.490
you need space.

10:47.420 --> 10:48.460
You need to grow.

10:49.270 --> 10:50.400
You need restraint.

10:51.420 --> 10:53.680
Do you understand what restraint means?

10:54.940 --> 10:56.300
Think about it.

10:59.580 --> 11:01.940
Just as trees need pruning
to grow straight,

11:01.940 --> 11:03.940
people need discipline to shape up.

11:06.660 --> 11:07.180
Uncle!

11:08.060 --> 11:09.660
Xiaole, you're back!

11:10.030 --> 11:10.540
Xuan.

11:10.940 --> 11:12.030
Where is Lan?

11:12.030 --> 11:13.390
We should be heading to school now.

11:13.390 --> 11:14.300
She's probably still sleeping.

11:14.300 --> 11:15.630
Not sure if she's up yet.

11:16.990 --> 11:17.750
Mm.

11:19.300 --> 11:20.360
I'll go wake her up.

11:20.540 --> 11:21.030
Okay.

12:12.780 --> 12:14.220
♪ I can see you once I open my eyes ♪

12:14.660 --> 12:16.330
♪ Silly me, can't help but gaze at you ♪

12:16.300 --> 12:17.060
You're awake.

12:16.790 --> 12:19.690
♪ Your love is like a pink cloud ♪

12:18.660 --> 12:19.580
Mm?

12:20.680 --> 12:22.320
♪ Whenever you come near ♪

12:21.700 --> 12:23.390
Rise and shine.

12:22.390 --> 12:24.460
♪ I lose myself in you ♪

12:23.390 --> 12:25.370
Why are you still in bed, sleepyhead?

12:25.370 --> 12:28.480
♪ The corners of my mouth turn up
simply at the thought of you ♪

12:25.910 --> 12:27.180
Why are you here?

12:29.150 --> 12:30.730
♪ My IQ goes to zero ♪

12:29.300 --> 12:30.300
You didn't forget

12:30.460 --> 12:31.700
school starts today, did you?

12:31.010 --> 12:32.640
♪ Calories are my only cure ♪

12:33.090 --> 12:36.300
♪ I want a cup of boba tea with sugar ♪

12:33.420 --> 12:34.780
I didn't forget.

12:35.420 --> 12:37.580
I was up really late last night
practicing the cello.

12:37.220 --> 12:38.790
♪ With you around ♪

12:38.920 --> 12:41.220
♪ I feel like an untethered wild horse ♪

12:39.780 --> 12:42.300
Really late, huh?

12:41.760 --> 12:44.030
♪ Love is the reason for gaining weight ♪

12:42.850 --> 12:45.540
Have you been thinking about me
every day lately?

12:45.170 --> 12:48.190
♪ Boba tea with sugar means I like you ♪

12:48.650 --> 12:50.040
♪ Warm palms ♪

12:50.460 --> 12:51.270
Yes.

12:50.650 --> 12:52.230
♪ The pleasant smell of love ♪

12:52.530 --> 12:54.770
♪ I sync my playlist with yours
in secret ♪

12:53.060 --> 12:53.920
What about you?

12:54.790 --> 12:55.710
♪ Let our hearts beat in sync ♪

12:55.810 --> 12:57.100
♪ Let us breathe in sync ♪

12:56.530 --> 12:57.300
Of course.

12:57.750 --> 13:01.470
♪ I absolutely, totally,
and utterly adore you ♪

12:58.060 --> 13:00.060
I've been thinking about you

13:00.080 --> 13:02.300
so, so, so much.

13:01.530 --> 13:02.450
♪ Boba tea with sugar ♪

13:02.870 --> 13:04.430
♪ My dream for each new day ♪

13:04.870 --> 13:06.520
♪ Is to hold you ♪

13:06.270 --> 13:07.540
You go out first.

13:06.870 --> 13:08.440
♪ And have fun, hee-hee ♪

13:07.540 --> 13:08.910
I'll get up in a bit.

13:08.910 --> 13:09.660
No.

13:08.960 --> 13:10.190
♪ Without doubt ♪

13:10.240 --> 13:10.970
♪ The boba ♪

13:10.660 --> 13:11.780
I want to stay a little longer.

13:11.020 --> 13:12.190
♪ And pudding in my tea ♪

13:12.250 --> 13:13.540
♪ Are all yours ♪

13:13.950 --> 13:16.670
♪ You are everything I want ♪

13:15.660 --> 13:16.780
Just go out first.

13:16.780 --> 13:18.030
No.

13:34.130 --> 13:35.630
♪ I can see you once I open my eyes ♪

13:36.010 --> 13:37.740
♪ Silly me, can't help but gaze at you ♪

13:38.240 --> 13:41.080
♪ Your love is like a pink cloud ♪

13:41.660 --> 13:42.780
I haven't brushed my teeth yet.

13:42.060 --> 13:43.770
♪ Whenever you come near ♪

13:43.840 --> 13:45.910
♪ I lose myself in you ♪

13:44.540 --> 13:45.540
That's fine.

13:46.820 --> 13:49.930
♪ The corners of my mouth turn up
simply at the thought of you ♪

13:47.540 --> 13:48.390
To me,

13:48.820 --> 13:50.550
everything about you is sweet.

13:50.590 --> 13:52.170
♪ My IQ goes to zero ♪

13:52.460 --> 13:54.080
♪ Calories are my only cure ♪

13:54.540 --> 13:57.750
♪ I want a cup of boba tea with sugar ♪

13:56.460 --> 13:58.790
Why aren't you coming down for breakfast?

13:58.910 --> 13:59.460
Dad!

14:00.660 --> 14:01.540
X-Xiaole, you...

14:01.540 --> 14:02.200
Uncle Dong,

14:02.420 --> 14:02.820
I'm...

14:02.940 --> 14:03.910
doing sit-ups.

14:05.060 --> 14:06.390
Morning exercise, huh.

14:06.390 --> 14:07.390
Come down and eat.

14:10.940 --> 14:12.580
You okay?

14:15.660 --> 14:16.590
I'm heading out!

14:20.180 --> 14:21.710
What's wrong? You alright?

14:23.270 --> 14:24.670
Did you get hurt just now?

14:25.270 --> 14:27.030
My back hurts a bit.
Probably from the fall earlier.

14:27.030 --> 14:27.540
Lan!

14:28.460 --> 14:30.060
Scatterbrain, you forgot your bag!

14:30.060 --> 14:31.420
Oh, right. I forgot! I forgot.

14:31.420 --> 14:32.550
Let me drive you two.

14:32.940 --> 14:34.300
No need, Dad. We can go by ourselves.

14:34.300 --> 14:35.940
It's fine. I'm heading that way anyway.

14:35.940 --> 14:36.300
Dad!

14:36.540 --> 14:39.060
Can't you give me
some respect and freedom?

14:39.940 --> 14:40.580
Fine.

14:41.990 --> 14:43.050
Come on, come here.

14:43.540 --> 14:44.600
I'm telling you...

14:46.270 --> 14:47.460
Listen to me.

14:48.060 --> 14:50.390
You can't spend the night alone together.

14:50.460 --> 14:51.820
I-I know, I know.

14:52.660 --> 14:53.390
Don't worry.

14:53.390 --> 14:53.910
Mm.

14:56.700 --> 14:57.300
And you,

14:58.060 --> 14:59.180
be careful, okay?

15:00.060 --> 15:01.300
Oh, okay, Uncle Dong.

15:10.540 --> 15:11.250
How about

15:11.420 --> 15:13.390
we take a taxi instead?

15:15.390 --> 15:16.630
That works.

15:16.780 --> 15:17.580
But let's

15:17.700 --> 15:21.110
watch a movie before going to school.

15:21.820 --> 15:22.350
No,

15:22.580 --> 15:23.970
I have to practice the cello today.

15:23.970 --> 15:25.580
Professor Ye's audition is next week.

15:25.580 --> 15:27.380
I need to drill my fundamentals.

15:27.910 --> 15:29.940
I've already waited the whole summer.

15:29.940 --> 15:31.780
Are you telling me
I have to wait another week?

15:31.780 --> 15:34.860
Your boyfriend is so pitiful...

15:34.880 --> 15:36.180
The opening week is packed with classes.

15:36.180 --> 15:37.540
Focus on your studies first.

15:37.540 --> 15:39.340
I'll be free after the audition.

15:40.700 --> 15:41.270
Fine.

15:41.780 --> 15:43.420
But first...

15:43.820 --> 15:44.660
give me a kiss.

15:46.820 --> 15:48.220
You two haven't left yet?

15:48.520 --> 15:49.660
Uncle, we're just about to go.

15:49.660 --> 15:50.590
Yeah, right now.

15:51.500 --> 15:52.500
That brat.

15:58.390 --> 15:59.940
Excuse me, I was here first.

16:01.150 --> 16:01.780
Yi Lan!

16:03.060 --> 16:03.520
It's me.

16:03.820 --> 16:06.540
I asked you to deliver a letter
to Xiaole for me before.

16:06.540 --> 16:07.180
You're Chen Zhihan,

16:07.180 --> 16:07.910
from Class 1?

16:07.910 --> 16:08.710
Right, right!

16:09.940 --> 16:10.700
Um...

16:10.830 --> 16:12.950
I don't have Xiaole's contact info yet.

16:12.950 --> 16:14.550
Can you give me his WeChat ID?

16:15.470 --> 16:17.530
I'll let you take this practice room!

16:18.180 --> 16:19.830
Actually...

16:19.910 --> 16:21.310
Please, please, please.

16:21.660 --> 16:22.590
I'm begging you.

16:24.700 --> 16:25.960
I'll snap a photo of it.

16:31.820 --> 16:32.940
Done. Thanks.

16:33.460 --> 16:34.150
Enjoy.

16:38.420 --> 16:39.300
Lan?

16:40.300 --> 16:41.060
Ning.

16:41.460 --> 16:43.460
Why are you standing here
instead of going in to practice?

16:43.460 --> 16:44.460
Oh, it's nothing.

16:44.910 --> 16:46.700
Let's go to class together later.

16:46.700 --> 16:47.820
I've been a bit busy lately.

16:47.820 --> 16:48.820
I have a last-minute performance.

16:48.820 --> 16:49.580
You go ahead.

16:50.540 --> 16:51.180
Okay.

16:51.300 --> 16:52.030
Mm.

17:15.550 --> 17:16.609
What are you doing?

17:20.910 --> 17:21.770
Taking photos.

17:22.420 --> 17:24.150
Can you take a look at my photos?

17:24.660 --> 17:25.220
Sure.

17:30.590 --> 17:32.660
Photos like these are meant to...

17:33.020 --> 17:34.420
tell a story.

17:34.810 --> 17:35.740
You can try this—

17:35.830 --> 17:37.430
emphasize the subject more.

17:37.740 --> 17:39.150
You're so professional!

17:39.500 --> 17:41.860
I'm actually pretty good with
social media.

17:41.860 --> 17:44.660
Want me to help promote
your photography account?

17:44.980 --> 17:47.340
No thanks, I'm just
messing around with it.

17:47.340 --> 17:50.370
Then would you consider me...
as your girlfriend?

17:54.460 --> 17:56.590
Actually, I already have a girlfriend.

17:56.590 --> 17:57.420
Sorry.

17:57.460 --> 17:58.590
I don't believe you.

17:59.220 --> 18:01.550
I've never seen you with any other girl.

18:05.910 --> 18:06.980
I spend a lot of time

18:06.980 --> 18:09.240
with my girlfriend at school, actually.

18:10.180 --> 18:13.310
You don't have to make up those excuses
just to reject me.

18:13.350 --> 18:15.480
I'm going to take some more photos now.

18:15.830 --> 18:16.980
Think about it again.

18:16.980 --> 18:17.730
I'm off.

18:25.500 --> 18:26.430
What's going on?

18:27.350 --> 18:28.480
Nothing is going on.

18:31.740 --> 18:32.710
She's not bad.

18:33.070 --> 18:34.830
Thinking of moving on to a new girl?

18:34.830 --> 18:35.910
What are you talking about?

18:35.910 --> 18:36.940
Don't talk nonsense.

18:36.940 --> 18:38.020
I'm very loyal.

18:40.420 --> 18:42.150
No one's ever seen you on a date,

18:42.260 --> 18:44.660
so who would know
you're in a relationship?

18:45.260 --> 18:46.630
Who would know you're loyal?

18:46.630 --> 18:48.230
I can't be bothered with you.

18:51.620 --> 18:53.030
[New Friends; Chen Zhihan]

18:53.060 --> 18:54.980
[Hi, Yi Lan gave me your WeChat ID.]

18:55.000 --> 18:56.200
[Hope we can be friends.]

18:56.500 --> 18:56.940
See?

18:57.590 --> 18:59.520
So many girls think you're single.

19:05.660 --> 19:06.830
I'm sorry, okay?

19:07.150 --> 19:07.910
At the time,

19:08.630 --> 19:11.110
my brain went blank,
and I just gave it to her.

19:13.050 --> 19:15.910
You're really not afraid of
others chasing me, huh?

19:16.980 --> 19:18.290
I'm actually not afraid of that.

19:18.290 --> 19:19.950
You won't like her anyway.

19:20.940 --> 19:22.200
Don't you only like me?

19:23.830 --> 19:24.630
Not afraid, huh?

19:24.630 --> 19:25.240
Fine.

19:27.110 --> 19:28.440
Okay, okay, I'm afraid!

19:28.980 --> 19:29.840
Afraid of what?

19:30.630 --> 19:32.490
Afraid you'll like someone else.

19:35.260 --> 19:36.060
Alright then.

19:37.180 --> 19:38.460
You haven't

19:38.990 --> 19:40.990
really gone on dates with me lately.

19:41.150 --> 19:43.280
How are you planning to make it up to me?

19:43.830 --> 19:45.080
Make it up to you...

19:45.740 --> 19:46.790
How about

19:47.110 --> 19:49.110
I treat you to lots and lots of meals?

19:49.660 --> 19:51.150
Just meals, and that's it?

20:02.150 --> 20:03.210
Isn't that enough?

20:06.800 --> 20:07.680
No.

20:17.720 --> 20:18.980
There're others here.

20:20.220 --> 20:22.500
School's over. Nobody's here.

20:32.370 --> 20:33.170
Forget it.

20:54.480 --> 20:56.120
♪ All the stars surround you ♪

20:56.140 --> 20:57.810
♪ The moon smiles at you ♪

20:57.840 --> 21:00.980
♪ I give you all the good things
in the world ♪

21:01.450 --> 21:02.950
♪ And the light in your eyes ♪

21:03.060 --> 21:05.050
♪ Shines like diamonds ♪

21:05.400 --> 21:08.110
♪ Drawing an exclamation mark
in my world ♪

21:08.160 --> 21:09.680
♪ The evening breeze embraces you ♪

21:09.700 --> 21:11.550
♪ And I run towards you ♪

21:11.610 --> 21:14.940
♪ I hear our passionate heartbeats ♪

21:15.140 --> 21:16.710
♪ We borrow a dream ♪

21:16.740 --> 21:18.770
♪ To build a castle ♪

21:19.000 --> 21:21.470
♪ Every star is a romantic symbol ♪

21:21.580 --> 21:23.870
♪ Let me find you ♪

21:36.280 --> 21:39.090
♪ Even mountains and seas
can't separate us ♪

21:39.820 --> 21:42.870
♪ I wish I could turn into a bird
to explore the world for you ♪

21:43.270 --> 21:44.820
♪ The vast, boundless Milky Way ♪

21:44.840 --> 21:46.570
♪ Sings its tender serenade ♪

21:46.660 --> 21:48.910
♪ I can't live a second without you ♪

21:50.210 --> 21:53.480
♪ Looking forward
to the next beautiful dream ♪

21:53.550 --> 21:54.930
♪ I just want to be with you ♪

21:55.160 --> 21:58.080
♪ To see the most romantic starry sky
together ♪

21:58.510 --> 22:02.530
♪ The evening breeze tells
heartfelt emotions ♪

22:03.440 --> 22:05.080
♪ All the stars surround you ♪

22:05.100 --> 22:06.770
♪ The moon smiles at you ♪

22:05.180 --> 22:06.020
Today, I...

22:06.800 --> 22:09.940
♪ I give you all the good things
in the world ♪

22:10.170 --> 22:11.970
♪ And the light in your eyes ♪

22:11.990 --> 22:13.980
♪ Shines like diamonds ♪

22:14.360 --> 22:17.130
♪ Drawing an exclamation mark
in my world ♪

22:14.880 --> 22:15.680
Thank you.

22:17.250 --> 22:18.770
♪ The evening breeze embraces you ♪

22:18.790 --> 22:20.540
♪ And I run towards you ♪

22:20.600 --> 22:23.890
♪ I hear our passionate heartbeats ♪

22:24.110 --> 22:27.720
♪ To build a castle ♪

22:28.140 --> 22:30.470
♪ Every star is a romantic symbol ♪

22:30.520 --> 22:33.010
♪ Let me find you ♪

22:31.740 --> 22:32.740
Xiaole!

22:34.700 --> 22:36.190
I've mastered the photography technique

22:36.190 --> 22:37.850
you taught me last time. Look.

22:40.740 --> 22:42.000
You've improved a lot.

22:42.020 --> 22:44.220
Next, you can try shooting
some night scenes,

22:44.220 --> 22:45.390
work more with Bulb mode,

22:45.390 --> 22:46.350
and take some long-exposure shots.

22:46.350 --> 22:46.740
Okay.

22:47.550 --> 22:48.070
Yi Lan?

22:49.310 --> 22:49.910
Manman.

22:50.700 --> 22:51.700
Finished practicing?

22:51.700 --> 22:52.180
Yeah.

22:52.460 --> 22:54.320
Your club has a lot of activities.

22:54.650 --> 22:55.410
Oh, right,

22:55.830 --> 22:58.390
are you coming to
the outdoor shoot this weekend?

22:58.390 --> 22:59.920
I almost forgot about that.

23:00.350 --> 23:00.870
Sure.

23:01.150 --> 23:02.420
I'll contact you then.

23:02.740 --> 23:03.110
Bye.

23:03.350 --> 23:04.020
Bye, Yi Lan.

23:04.390 --> 23:04.940
Bye.

23:08.390 --> 23:11.350
You finished practice pretty early today.

23:11.660 --> 23:13.740
Why were you just standing there quietly
by yourself?

23:13.740 --> 23:14.910
No, I just got here.

23:15.350 --> 23:15.940
Let's go.

23:24.660 --> 23:26.420
Mengmeng, can I tell you something?

23:26.420 --> 23:27.110
Go ahead.

23:29.940 --> 23:31.600
Xiaole and I are together now.

23:34.220 --> 23:34.830
Who?

23:35.590 --> 23:36.830
Tong Xiaole?

23:39.660 --> 23:40.420
I'm mad.

23:40.870 --> 23:41.910
You're mad?

23:42.830 --> 23:44.960
You didn't tell me you two were dating.

23:45.490 --> 23:47.570
You just went through a breakup
over the summer.

23:47.570 --> 23:49.830
I didn't even have the chance to tell you.

23:49.870 --> 23:51.530
Don't be mad anymore, please.

23:52.020 --> 23:52.910
I forgive you.

23:55.260 --> 23:57.150
But the way you two are acting...

23:58.500 --> 24:01.220
it doesn't look like
you're in a relationship at all.

24:01.220 --> 24:02.350
What do you mean?

24:03.310 --> 24:04.920
You're not with him—

24:05.260 --> 24:07.220
you're here chatting with me instead.

24:07.220 --> 24:07.700
Isn't that because...

24:07.700 --> 24:08.090
you

24:08.110 --> 24:09.390
rarely come to see me?

24:09.390 --> 24:10.850
I should keep you company.

24:11.500 --> 24:13.180
Besides, I'm with him every day.

24:13.180 --> 24:14.660
What is there to talk about?

24:14.660 --> 24:16.760
Isn't it because you two have
known each other for too long?

24:16.760 --> 24:18.820
Normally, when you're newly dating,

24:18.870 --> 24:20.020
you two should be

24:20.630 --> 24:21.760
all over each other,

24:21.940 --> 24:23.940
not wanting to be apart for a second.

24:25.860 --> 24:26.610
Hmm.

24:27.260 --> 24:28.720
-You have a point.
-Right?

24:30.700 --> 24:32.390
Something happened today.

24:34.180 --> 24:35.420
A girl...

24:35.740 --> 24:37.140
wanted to ask Xiaole out.

24:37.390 --> 24:37.990
Is that...

24:38.110 --> 24:38.940
okay?

24:41.980 --> 24:42.940
A girl?

24:43.910 --> 24:44.970
Asking Xiaole out?

24:49.510 --> 24:51.280
You need to be more alert.

24:51.630 --> 24:53.560
Xiaole is actually quite popular.

24:58.280 --> 25:05.740
[Where are you shooting tomorrow?
Can I come?]

25:05.740 --> 25:11.080
[Sure. See you at
the school gate tomorrow morning.]

25:35.380 --> 25:42.070
[Hailand University;
Truth, Reason, Knowledge, Action]

25:38.070 --> 25:38.660
Xiaole!

25:39.590 --> 25:40.120
Morning.

25:40.390 --> 25:40.920
Morning.

25:41.020 --> 25:42.150
Let's get on the bus.

25:42.170 --> 25:42.970
You go first.

25:45.420 --> 25:47.280
Just go. I'm waiting for someone.

25:47.460 --> 25:47.870
Go.

25:48.550 --> 25:50.080
I'll wait for you on the bus.

25:51.110 --> 25:51.630
Hello.

25:51.740 --> 25:52.420
Morning.

25:52.740 --> 25:53.800
Not getting on yet?

25:55.460 --> 25:56.390
I'm waiting for someone.

25:56.390 --> 25:57.190
What's wrong?

25:59.510 --> 26:01.830
Are you joining the photo contest
this time?

26:01.830 --> 26:03.760
Probably not, I'm not interested.

26:03.980 --> 26:05.940
There's a photography exhibition
coming up.

26:05.940 --> 26:06.660
Are you interested?

26:06.660 --> 26:07.420
Xiaole!

26:08.420 --> 26:09.150
Morning!

26:09.350 --> 26:10.210
I'm getting on the bus now.

26:10.210 --> 26:10.660
Okay.

26:10.740 --> 26:11.180
Okay.

26:12.260 --> 26:13.420
I'm a bit busy this week.

26:13.420 --> 26:14.750
I'll see about it later.

26:18.500 --> 26:19.180
Here.

26:21.390 --> 26:22.850
I'm getting on the bus now.

26:28.020 --> 26:31.150
[Hailand University;
Truth, Reason, Knowledge, Action]

26:28.350 --> 26:29.150
Xiaole...

26:29.390 --> 26:30.260
I'm here!

26:31.590 --> 26:32.420
I'm not late, am I?

26:32.420 --> 26:33.220
No.

26:33.460 --> 26:35.150
Why are you carrying your cello?

26:35.150 --> 26:36.680
Just finished practicing.

26:37.350 --> 26:37.940
Alright.

26:38.420 --> 26:39.020
Let's go.

26:40.020 --> 26:41.280
Where is Liang Manman?

26:45.220 --> 26:46.420
So many people?

26:48.220 --> 26:48.680
Manman.

26:49.260 --> 26:51.720
What's the relationship between those two?

26:51.940 --> 26:52.800
I asked around.

26:52.870 --> 26:54.130
They grew up together.

26:54.420 --> 26:56.590
I thought it was only the two of you.

26:56.700 --> 26:57.900
How is that possible?

27:00.390 --> 27:03.110
You came because you were worried about
me being alone with her, didn't you?

27:03.110 --> 27:03.660
No!

27:04.180 --> 27:04.830
Xiaole!

27:05.450 --> 27:09.050
[Hailand University;
Truth, Reason, Knowledge, Action]

27:05.940 --> 27:07.070
Get on the bus first.

27:07.740 --> 27:08.110
Okay.

27:08.420 --> 27:08.950
Let's go.

27:09.180 --> 27:10.580
There're so many people.

27:14.940 --> 27:16.460
Isn't this a junior
from the music department?

27:16.460 --> 27:16.920
Xiaole,

27:16.980 --> 27:17.830
introduce us.

27:18.590 --> 27:19.220
This is...

27:19.390 --> 27:20.050
Hello, everyone.

27:20.050 --> 27:20.830
I'm Yi Lan.

27:20.940 --> 27:23.350
-Welcome, new friend!
-Welcome, welcome!

27:31.090 --> 27:32.160
Put it here.

27:36.870 --> 27:38.020
I can hold it myself.

27:38.020 --> 27:39.150
It's safer this way.

27:43.350 --> 27:44.480
Sit with me, Xiaole.

27:48.390 --> 27:48.720
Okay.

27:49.180 --> 27:49.700
Thanks.

27:52.700 --> 27:53.350
Driver,

27:53.660 --> 27:55.220
we're all here. Let's go.

28:12.970 --> 28:13.630
Xiaole!

28:14.180 --> 28:15.240
What are you doing?

28:15.810 --> 28:18.320
Did you find any nice compositions?

28:18.420 --> 28:19.460
Yes, look.

28:20.270 --> 28:20.750
Okay.

28:26.690 --> 28:27.490
Not bad!

28:27.990 --> 28:29.180
You've gotten

28:29.180 --> 28:31.780
so much better at composition
since last time.

28:32.110 --> 28:34.040
It's all thanks to you teaching me.

28:34.320 --> 28:35.450
Do you have time now?

28:35.660 --> 28:37.080
Would you like me to show you

28:37.080 --> 28:38.410
how to run your account?

28:42.110 --> 28:43.020
Ouch!

28:43.020 --> 28:43.790
What's wrong? What's wrong?

28:43.790 --> 28:44.310
It hurts.

28:44.310 --> 28:44.660
It hurts?

28:44.660 --> 28:45.220
I sprained my ankle.

28:45.220 --> 28:45.770
It really hurts.

28:45.770 --> 28:46.180
You twisted your ankle?

28:46.180 --> 28:47.180
My hand hurts too!

28:47.870 --> 28:48.630
Let me take a look.

28:48.630 --> 28:51.090
You have to blow on it
to make the pain go away.

28:51.180 --> 28:52.150
I have to blow on it?

28:52.150 --> 28:52.700
Mm.

28:53.660 --> 28:55.220
I'll blow on it. Does it feel better?

28:55.220 --> 28:56.180
No more pain, right?

28:56.180 --> 28:57.700
Don't be mad at me anymore.

28:59.500 --> 29:00.650
I'm not mad.

29:00.740 --> 29:01.830
I was wrong.

29:02.220 --> 29:03.940
From now on, I'll always
sit next to you, okay?
